{"height": 3, "weight": 28, "base_experience": 60, "ev_yield": [{"stat": "special-defense", "value": 1}], "genus": "Soft Tissue Pokémon", "capture_rate": 45, "base_happiness": 35, "hatch_counter": 40, "growth_rate": "slow", "egg_groups": ["dragon"], "gender_rate": 4, "names": [{"language": "ja-hrkt", "name": "ヌメラ"}, {"language": "ja-roma", "name": "Numera"}, {"language": "ko", "name": "미끄메라"}, {"language": "zh-hant", "name": "黏黏寶"}, {"language": "fr", "name": "Mucuscule"}, {"language": "de", "name": "Viscora"}, {"language": "es", "name": "Goomy"}, {"language": "it", "name": "Goomy"}, {"language": "ja", "name": "ヌメラ"}, {"language": "zh-hans", "name": "黏黏宝"}, {"language": "es-419", "name": "Goomy"}], "pokedex_entries": [{"versions": ["x", "omega-ruby"], "text": "The weakest Dragon-type Pokémon, it lives in damp, shady places, so its body doesn’t dry out."}, {"versions": ["y", "alpha-sapphire"], "text": "It’s covered in a slimy membrane that makes any punches or kicks slide off it harmlessly."}, {"versions": ["sun"], "text": "The weakest of all Dragon-type Pokémon, it’s unable to breathe if its skin dries out, so it sticks to shady places."}, {"versions": ["moon"], "text": "Its source of protection is its slimy, germ-laden mucous membrane. Anyone who touches it needs some thorough hand-washing."}, {"versions": ["ultra-sun"], "text": "It uses its horns to check out its surroundings. They’re very sensitive, so if you grab them, it will feel a strong shock and be unable to move."}, {"versions": ["ultra-moon"], "text": "Its body is mostly water. If it dries out, it will die, so it’s always sitting with perfect stillness in the shade."}, {"versions": ["sword"], "text": "Because most of its body is water, it will dry up if the weather becomes too arid. It’s considered the weakest dragon Pokémon."}, {"versions": ["shield"], "text": "Their horns are powerful sensors. As soon as Goomy pick up any sign of enemies, they go into hiding. This is how they’ve survived."}, {"versions"